  "description": "Wrapper for anchore/grype — focused CVE/vulnerability scanner across 20+ language ecosystems (Rust, npm, .NET, Go, Java, Python, PHP, etc.) plus all major Linux distros. Reads CycloneDX/SPDX/syft-json SBOMs (pairs natively with Tamp.Syft) or scans directories / files / container images directly. EPSS + KEV + CVSS composite risk scoring for prioritization. CI gating via --fail-on severity.",
